DETAILED SCENARIOS

Scenario 1: Student Finds and Books a Tutor

Actor: Student
Precondition: Student has completed profile setup
Flow:

    Student logs in and views dashboard (UC-06)
    Student clicks "Browse Tutors" (UC-07)
    Student filters by subject "Mathematics" (UC-09)
    Student clicks "View Profile" on a tutor (UC-10)
    Student clicks "Request a Session" button (UC-11)
    System sends request to tutor
    Student receives confirmation notification

Postcondition: Session request is pending tutor approval

Scenario 2: Tutor Accepts Session and Conducts Tutoring

Actor: Tutor
Precondition: Student has requested a session
Flow:

    Tutor logs in and views dashboard (UC-18)
    Tutor sees "2 New Requests" in Session Requests section (UC-19)
    Tutor reviews student request details
    Tutor clicks "Accept" button (UC-20)
    System confirms session and notifies student
    At session time, tutor clicks "Start Session" (UC-23)
    Tutor conducts 1-on-1 tutoring

Postcondition: Session is completed, statistics updated

Scenario 3: Student Joins and Reviews Session

Actor: Student
Precondition: Session has been confirmed by tutor
Flow:

    Student navigates to "My Sessions" (UC-12)
    Student selects "Upcoming" tab
    Student clicks "Join Session" at scheduled time (UC-13)
    Student participates in tutoring
    After completion, student views "Completed" tab
    Student clicks "Leave Review" (UC-17)
    Student rates tutor and submits feedback

Postcondition: Review is saved, tutor rating updated
